      "name": "nuwax_ask_question",
      "description": "Present an interactive form card to the user and wait for their response. Use nuwax_ask_question when you need user input, preferences, decisions, choices, confirmations, or structured data.\n\nALWAYS use this tool instead of guessing, assuming, or asking in plain text.\nDO NOT ask for secrets (passwords, API keys, tokens).\n\nProvide a nuwax.interaction.v1 UI schema in the ui field. Returns status \"pending\" immediately; the user's answer arrives as a subsequent chat message.\n\nSchema rules: Use enum + enumNames for choices. NEVER show bare values without labels.\n\nExample: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.mcp_ask.v1\",\"requestId\":\"ask_1\",\"revision\":1,\"sessionId\":\"sess_1\",\"title\":\"Choose\",\"ui\":{\"version\":\"nuwax.interaction.v1\",\"presentation\":\"inline\",\"title\":\"Pick one\",\"schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"choice\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"agree\",\"decline\"],\"enumNames\":[\"Yes, I agree\",\"No, I decline\"]}},\"required\":[\"choice\"]}}}",
